 libdbi-perl,
 libdbd-pg-perl,
 libjson-xs-perl,
 libyaml-libyaml-perl,
 libdigest-sha-perl,
 libarchive-zip-perl,
 libimage-magick-perl,
 libfile-libmagic-perl,
 postgresql-client,
 adduser
Description: Homelab Drive background task processor
 Processes queued file tasks (content_type, sha256, delete, virus scan) out-of-band
 from the Homelab API workers. Runs as a standalone daemon managed
 by systemd. Can be deployed on the same host as the API or separately.
